@host = http://localhost:8080

### 1. Login admin -> luu token
# @name loginAdmin
POST {{host}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "login": "adminuser",
  "password": "Admin@12345"
}

###
@adminToken = {{loginAdmin.response.body.token}}

### 2. Login useralpha
# @name loginAlpha
POST {{host}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "login": "useralpha",
  "password": "User@12345"
}

###
@alphaToken = {{loginAlpha.response.body.token}}

### 3. Login userbeta
# @name loginBeta
POST {{host}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "login": "userbeta",
  "password": "User@12345"
}

###
@betaToken = {{loginBeta.response.body.token}}

### 4. Sai mat khau -> 401 UNAUTHENTICATED
POST {{host}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "login": "adminuser",
  "password": "wrong"
}

### 5. Body rong -> 400 VALIDATION_ERROR, fieldErrors khong rong
POST {{host}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### 6. Khong co token -> 401 qua CustomAuthenticationEntryPoint
GET {{host}}/api/v1/orders

### 7. Token rac -> 401
GET {{host}}/api/v1/orders
Authorization: Bearer abc.def.ghi

### 8. Token hop le -> 401 bien mat (se la 404 vi chua co endpoint)
GET {{host}}/api/v1/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{alphaToken}}

### 9. JSON hong -> 400 MALFORMED_REQUEST
POST {{host}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"login": "adminuser", "password":

### 10. Sai HTTP method -> 405 METHOD_NOT_ALLOWED
GET {{host}}/api/v1/auth/login

### 11. Path variable sai kieu -> se la 400 MALFORMED_REQUEST sau chunk toi
GET {{host}}/api/v1/orders/abc
Authorization: Bearer {{alphaToken}}

### 12. Tao product (ADMIN) -> 201
POST {{host}}/api/v1/products
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

{
  "name": "Wireless Mouse",
  "price": 250000.00,
  "stock": 10,
  "active": true
}

### 13. Tao product voi stock nho, de test concurrency sau
POST {{host}}/api/v1/products
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

{
  "name": "Limited Keyboard",
  "price": 1200000.00,
  "stock": 5,
  "active": true
}

### 14. Product inactive, de test PRODUCT_NOT_ACTIVE
POST {{host}}/api/v1/products
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

{
  "name": "Discontinued Headset",
  "price": 500000.00,
  "stock": 20,
  "active": false
}

### 15. USER tao product -> 403 ACCESS_DENIED
POST {{host}}/api/v1/products
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{alphaToken}}

{
  "name": "Should Fail",
  "price": 100000.00,
  "stock": 1,
  "active": true
}

### 16. List products (public)
GET {{host}}/api/v1/products

### 17. Tao order thanh cong -> 201
POST {{host}}/api/v1/orders
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{alphaToken}}

{
  "items": [
    { "productId": 1, "quantity": 2 },
    { "productId": 2, "quantity": 1 }
  ],
  "shippingAddress": "123 Nguyen Hue, Quy Nhon",
  "note": "Giao gio hanh chinh"
}

### 18. Product trung lap -> 400 DUPLICATE_PRODUCT
POST {{host}}/api/v1/orders
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{alphaToken}}

{
  "items": [
    { "productId": 1, "quantity": 1 },
    { "productId": 1, "quantity": 3 }
  ],
  "shippingAddress": "123 Nguyen Hue, Quy Nhon"
}

### 19. Product khong ton tai -> 404 PRODUCT_NOT_FOUND
POST {{host}}/api/v1/orders
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{alphaToken}}

{
  "items": [ { "productId": 9999, "quantity": 1 } ],
  "shippingAddress": "123 Nguyen Hue, Quy Nhon"
}

### 20. Product inactive -> 409 PRODUCT_NOT_ACTIVE
POST {{host}}/api/v1/orders
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{alphaToken}}

{
  "items": [ { "productId": 3, "quantity": 1 } ],
  "shippingAddress": "123 Nguyen Hue, Quy Nhon"
}

### 21. Khong du stock -> 409 INSUFFICIENT_STOCK
POST {{host}}/api/v1/orders
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{alphaToken}}

{
  "items": [ { "productId": 2, "quantity": 999 } ],
  "shippingAddress": "123 Nguyen Hue, Quy Nhon"
}

### 22. Rollback toan bo: item 1 hop le, item 2 het hang -> stock product 1 KHONG giam
POST {{host}}/api/v1/orders
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{alphaToken}}

{
  "items": [
    { "productId": 1, "quantity": 1 },
    { "productId": 2, "quantity": 999 }
  ],
  "shippingAddress": "123 Nguyen Hue, Quy Nhon"
}

### 23. Kiem tra stock sau khoi 22 - phai giong truoc do
GET {{host}}/api/v1/products

### 24. List don cua alpha
GET {{host}}/api/v1/orders?page=0&size=10
Authorization: Bearer {{alphaToken}}

### 25. Chi tiet don cua chinh minh -> 200
GET {{host}}/api/v1/orders/1
Authorization: Bearer {{alphaToken}}

### 26. Beta xem don cua alpha -> 404 ORDER_NOT_FOUND (khong phai 403)
GET {{host}}/api/v1/orders/1
Authorization: Bearer {{betaToken}}

### 27. Path variable sai kieu -> 400 MALFORMED_REQUEST
GET {{host}}/api/v1/orders/abc
Authorization: Bearer {{alphaToken}}